<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-No tenders held.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-No tenders held.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
